  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that the scvi_n200 encoder with transformer aggregation in multiprofile RNA-only models (config_006) achieves the highest validation accuracy (0.653). This experiment tests adding image data (imagenet_vit_l encoder) to this strong baseline, isolating the potential impact of multimodal integration. It directly addresses whether combining RNA and image data improves performance, a critical design decision with uncertain benefits. This balances exploitation of the current best RNA-only setup with exploration of multimodal potential, avoiding unnecessary complexity while testing a key hypothesis."
}

